# DEPLOYMENT ONLY. You do not need a frontend/.env to run this locally.
#
# Do not copy this file to frontend/.env for local development. `npm run dev`
# with no .env sends API calls to /api, which vite.config.ts proxies to
# http://localhost:8000 -- that works out of the box and sidesteps CORS
# entirely. Copying this template verbatim instead points the app at
# your-backend.example.com, and every request fails with an opaque network
# error that looks like a broken app rather than a misconfiguration.
#
# Set this as an environment variable in Vercel (or your host) for a deployed
# build. No trailing slash.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
